{"id": "65471", "title": "军宠", "author": "森中一小妖", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65471.htm", "intro": "陆少校被逼着花二十万买了个媳妇。\r\n\r\n有了四十天婚假。\r\n\r\n四十天能干什么？\r\n\r\n能将自己水嫩可口的小媳妇揉圆搓扁再一口吃掉。\r\n\r\n各位看官们看过来\r\n\r\n①本文是温馨治愈文，全篇无虐~\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 婚恋 高干 军旅", "base": "files/article/html/65/65471", "chapters": [{"title": "1-4", "file": "9746942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-7", "file": "9746943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-12", "file": "9746944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-17", "file": "9746945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-21", "file": "9746948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-24", "file": "9746954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-27", "file": "9746956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-30", "file": "9746959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9746962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-37", "file": "9746964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-40完结", "file": "9746972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9746974.html", "available": false}]}